    "detailed_description": "<h1>Tips</h1><p>Bonus: Every 10 levels your bonus increases.\r\nWhen poop turns to gold there is a change to give a special item\r\nHelpers: They help collect poop and reward bonus items</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is the story of Cathy.\r\n\r\nShe is very catty and always wants to look pretty, but she always says mean things. When she walks she poops and it may turn to gold. She needs the gold to buy fillers for her face to look pretty. If you do not click on the poop and make it gold, her face will shrivel up and she will not be pretty. \r\n\r\nLet's help Cathy look pretty or maybe not!\r\n\r\nUse your mouse to tap on Cathy, poop to collect prizes, and tapping on vehicles will release food which makes her poop faster.\r\n\r\nOn the steam deck tap on the screen just like you would with a mouse.\r\n\r\nY - Use Botox\r\nX - Power up 1\r\nA - Power up 2\r\nB - Power up 3",
    "about_the_game": "This is the story of Cathy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShe is very catty and always wants to look pretty, but she always says mean things. When she walks she poops and it may turn to gold. She needs the gold to buy fillers for her face to look pretty. If you do not click on the poop and make it gold, her face will shrivel up and she will not be pretty. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet's help Cathy look pretty or maybe not!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your mouse to tap on Cathy, poop to collect prizes, and tapping on vehicles will release food which makes her poop faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the steam deck tap on the screen just like you would with a mouse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nY - Use Botox<br />\r\nX - Power up 1<br />\r\nA - Power up 2<br />\r\nB - Power up 3",
